HTML & CSS Button code:

```html
<button class="btn">Click Me</button>

<style>
.btn {
  background: #2563eb;
  color: white;
  padding: 10px 20px;
  border: none;
  border-radius: 8px;
  font-size: 16px;
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: 0.3s;
}
.btn:hover {
  background: #1d4ed8;
  transform: scale(1.05);
}
</style>
```
